4
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:34,640
In this talk, I'm going to show you how to booby trap a PDF document, track when a PDF

5
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:40,720
was opened and closed even when loaded from a file system, and exfiltrate the contents

6
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:45,200
of an unknown PDF on both Chrome and Acrobat.

7
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:50,920
All these techniques use a PDF injection.

8
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:56,620
My colleague, James Kettle, was watching a Black Hat talk about PDFs, and he was looking

9
00:00:56,620 --> 00:01:00,220
