15
00:01:16,600 --> 00:01:18,680
How could this be possible?

16
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:20,080
But that didn't stop me there.

17
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:25,140
I then began to test for PDF injection.

18
00:01:25,140 --> 00:01:31,400
